# CLAIRE Session Capsule Protocol

AI keeps losing the plot.

Every serious AI workflow eventually hits the same wall: the session resets, the context disappears, and the user has to rebuild everything manually.

What were we doing? What broke? What worked? What should not be repeated? What is the next safe step?

The **CLAIRE Session Capsule Protocol** is a proof-of-continuity system for AI workflows. It creates a portable handoff capsule that can be read by a later session so the next assistant can restore the operational state instead of starting cold.{
