## What this proves

This validates the core continuity loop:

1. create a structured capsule
2. enforce required fields
3. save machine-readable JSON
4. save human-readable Markdown
5. reload and validate the capsule
6. index saved capsules
7. recall the relevant capsule from a later query
8. preserve next-step and do-not-repeat boundaries

This is not a chatbot memory claim. It is a portable restore-point mechanism for AI workflow continuity.
